# SPA fallback rewrite.
#
# This app uses client-side routing, so any deep link (/projects/ai-platform,
# /blog/cloud-security, ...) must be served index.html and resolved by the
# router. Without this file those URLs return a host-level 404 even though the
# routes exist in the app.
#
# `200` makes it a rewrite rather than a redirect, so the URL is preserved.
# Real files in dist/ (hashed JS/CSS, images, favicon) take precedence over
# this rule on both Netlify and Cloudflare Pages, so assets are not shadowed.
#
# Recognised natively by: Netlify, Cloudflare Pages.
/*  /index.html  200
